<title>SPAIN: Rato says Spain to meet '96, '97 budget goals.</title>
<headline>Rato says Spain to meet '96, '97 budget goals.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Friday he was confident Spain would meet its 1996 and 1997 budget goals, for the first time in several years.</p>
<p>Rato added the 200 amendments in the budget law approved by parliament early today would increase public expenditure by 11.27 billion pesetas or 0.0157 percent of Gross Domestic Product.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
